@*
    The field of a form that carries the time zone of the device (NFR-USA-3). The script of the
    times, times.js, writes into it what the browser says its time zone is, and the page that
    takes the form keeps that on the device: see DeviceTimeZone. It is the field of a form and
    no form itself. Without the script it stays empty, nothing is kept, and the pages are in
    UTC. See docs/times.md.
*@

<input type="hidden" name="@DeviceTimeZone.Field" data-time-zone />
